=== Standing sanctions upon primary articles ===
{{Collapse top|Rescinded by [[#Motion: Repealing primary articles/related content distinction (October 2025)|motion]]}}
6) All primary articles will be subject to the ARBPIA General Sanctions. {{tl|ArbCom Arab-Israeli enforcement}} should be added to the talk page of affected pages, and {{tl|ArbCom Arab-Israeli editnotice}} should be added as an [[WP:EDN|editnotice]] to affected pages. The presence of the templates is required before the General Sanctions can be enforced on primary articles. The templates may be added to primary articles by any user, but may only be removed by an uninvolved administrator. Users who lack the appropriate permissions to create an editnotice should place the talk page template as normal, then make an [[WP:EDR|edit request]] for someone with permissions to create the edit notice.
{{Collapse bottom}}

:''Passed 6 to 0 at 05:06, 20 December 2019 (UTC)''
